<title>HONG KONG: Golden Harvest year net down 56.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Golden Harvest year net down 56.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   8.3    vs 22.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.1    vs 6.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs 8.38 gain</p>
<p>    Net			    43.21  vs 99.46</p>
<p>    Turnover		     259.34 vs 283.31</p>
<p>    Company name		 Golden Harvest Entertainment</p>
<p>				     (Holdings) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  November 13-21</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   December 13</p>
<p>NOTE - Golden Harvest Entertainment is a film maker and distributor.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 3.6 H.K. cents (including interim dividend of 2.5 cents) vs six cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
